# COMPONENT

## EventDriven

### PACKAGE

org.sample.eventdriven

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal event-driven sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This component emits one event, receives it through CNCF event reception,
and exposes the visible effect through a query.

# SERVICE

## Event

### DESCRIPTION

Event emission and observation operations.

### OPERATION

#### emitEvent

##### DESCRIPTION

Emits the `item.changed` event.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### EXECUTION
async

##### IMPLEMENTATION
event-emit

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
EmitEvent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
EmitEventResult

###### VALUE

####### EmitEventResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
|---------+--------+--------------|
| message | string | ?            |

#### recordEffect

##### DESCRIPTION

Receives the emitted event and records the visible effect.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### EXECUTION
sync

##### IMPLEMENTATION
event-effect-record

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
RecordEffect

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
RecordEffectResult

###### VALUE

####### RecordEffectResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
|---------+--------+--------------|
| message | string | ?            |

#### loadEffect

##### DESCRIPTION

Reads the current post-event effect.

##### TYPE
QUERY

##### IMPLEMENTATION
event-effect-load

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
LoadEffect

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
LoadEffectResult

###### VALUE

####### LoadEffectResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
|---------+--------+--------------|
| name    | name   | ?            |
| title   | string | ?            |
| message | string | ?            |

# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal entity used so the sample remains a generated component rather than a handwritten provider.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

# COMMAND

## EmitEvent

### DESCRIPTION

Command to emit the `item.changed` event.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |

## RecordEffect

### DESCRIPTION

Command to record the received event effect.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | ?            |
| title | string | ?            |

# QUERY

## LoadEffect

### DESCRIPTION

Query to read the current visible effect.

# EVENT

## item.changed
- CATEGORY :: ActionEvent
- KIND :: changed
- SELECTOR :: source=event-driven
- ACTION_NAME :: event-driven.event.record-effect
- PRIORITY :: 0
